          "language": "python",
          "filename": "09_1_edf_irls_cumulant_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef irls_glm(X: np.ndarray, y: np.ndarray, family: str, max_iter: int = 30, tol: float = 1e-8):\n    \"\"\"Generic First-Principles IRLS (Fisher Scoring) untuk 4 keluarga EDF utama.\"\"\"\n    n, p = X.shape\n    X_aug = np.column_stack([np.ones(n), X])\n    beta = np.zeros(p + 1)\n\n    # Inisialisasi mean yang valid pada domain masing-masing keluarga\n    if family == \"normal\":\n        beta[0] = float(np.mean(y))\n    elif family == \"bernoulli\":\n        p0 = float(np.clip(np.mean(y), 1e-4, 1.0 - 1e-4))\n        beta[0] = float(np.log(p0 / (1.0 - p0)))\n    else:  # poisson & gamma (log-link)\n        beta[0] = float(np.log(max(float(np.mean(y)), 1e-4)))\n\n    iters = 0\n    for it in range(1, max_iter + 1):\n        eta = X_aug @ beta\n        if family == \"normal\":\n            mu = eta\n            var_mu = np.ones_like(mu)\n            g_prime = np.ones_like(mu)\n        elif family == \"bernoulli\":\n            eta_c = np.clip(eta, -30.0, 30.0)\n            mu = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-eta_c))\n            var_mu = np.maximum(mu * (1.0 - mu), 1e-10)\n            g_prime = 1.0 / var_mu\n        elif family == \"poisson\":\n            eta_c = np.clip(eta, -20.0, 20.0)\n            mu = np.exp(eta_c)\n            var_mu = np.maximum(mu, 1e-10)\n            g_prime = 1.0 / var_mu\n        elif family == \"gamma_log\":\n            eta_c = np.clip(eta, -20.0, 20.0)\n            mu = np.exp(eta_c)\n            var_mu = np.maximum(mu ** 2, 1e-10)\n            g_prime = 1.0 / np.maximum(mu, 1e-10)\n        else:\n            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown family: {family}\")\n\n        # Bobot IRLS W = 1 / (V(mu) * (g'(mu))^2) dan working response z\n        w = 1.0 / (var_mu * (g_prime ** 2))\n        z = eta + (y - mu) * g_prime\n\n        XtW = X_aug.T * w\n        beta_new = np.linalg.solve(XtW @ X_aug + 1e-10 * np.eye(p + 1), XtW @ z)\n        iters = it\n        if float(np.max(np.abs(beta_new - beta))) < tol:\n            beta = beta_new\n            break\n        beta = beta_new\n\n    # Verifikasi norma gradien persamaan skor: X^T (W * g'(mu) * (y - mu))\n    eta = X_aug @ beta\n    if family == \"normal\":\n        mu, var_mu, g_prime = eta, np.ones(n), np.ones(n)\n    elif family == \"bernoulli\":\n        mu = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-np.clip(eta, -30.0, 30.0)))\n        var_mu = np.maximum(mu * (1.0 - mu), 1e-10)\n        g_prime = 1.0 / var_mu\n    elif family == \"poisson\":\n        mu = np.exp(np.clip(eta, -20.0, 20.0))\n        var_mu = np.maximum(mu, 1e-10)\n        g_prime = 1.0 / var_mu\n    else:\n        mu = np.exp(np.clip(eta, -20.0, 20.0))\n        var_mu = np.maximum(mu ** 2, 1e-10)\n        g_prime = 1.0 / np.maximum(mu, 1e-10)\n\n    score_vec = X_aug.T @ ((y - mu) / (var_mu * g_prime))\n    return beta, iters, float(np.max(np.abs(score_vec)))\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn = 1000\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 2))\nbeta_true = np.array([0.6, 0.45, -0.35])\n\n# Bangkitkan 4 target sesuai keluarga EDF masing-masing\neta_true = beta_true[0] + X @ beta_true[1:]\ny_norm = eta_true + rng.normal(0.0, 0.8, size=n)\ny_bern = rng.binomial(1, 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-eta_true))).astype(float)\ny_pois = rng.poisson(np.exp(eta_true)).astype(float)\ngamma_shape = 5.0  # phi = 1 / shape = 0.20\ny_gamm = rng.gamma(shape=gamma_shape, scale=np.exp(eta_true) / gamma_shape)\n\nprint(\"=== Verifikasi First-Principles IRLS Lintas Keluarga EDF (True beta = [0.60, 0.45, -0.35]) ===\")\nprint(\"Keluarga (Link)     | Iter |   b0_hat |   b1_hat |   b2_hat | Max |Score|\")\nprint(\"-\" * 75)\nfor name, fam, y_target in [\n    (\"Normal (Identity) \", \"normal\", y_norm),\n    (\"Bernoulli (Logit) \", \"bernoulli\", y_bern),\n    (\"Poisson (Log)     \", \"poisson\", y_pois),\n    (\"Gamma (Log-Link)  \", \"gamma_log\", y_gamm),\n]:\n    b_hat, iters, sc_norm = irls_glm(X, y_target, fam)\n    print(f\"{name:19s} | {iters:4d} | {b_hat[0]:+8.4f} | {b_hat[1]:+8.4f} | {b_hat[2]:+8.4f} | {sc_norm:11.2e}\")\n\n# Audit numerik identitas momen Bartlett b'(theta) & a(phi)*b''(theta) pada Poisson & Gamma\ntheta_p = np.log(4.5)\nb_prime_p = float(np.exp(theta_p))\nb_dprime_p = float(np.exp(theta_p))\nsamp_p = rng.poisson(b_prime_p, size=50000)\n\nmu_g, phi_g = 12.0, 0.25  # shape = 1/phi = 4.0\ntheta_g = -1.0 / mu_g\nb_prime_g = float(-1.0 / theta_g)\nvar_theo_g = float(phi_g * (1.0 / (theta_g ** 2)))\nsamp_g = rng.gamma(shape=1.0 / phi_g, scale=mu_g * phi_g, size=50000)\n\nprint(\"=== Verifikasi Identitas Cumulant E[Y]=b'(theta) & Var(Y)=a(phi)b''(theta) ===\")\nprint(f\"Poisson(mu=4.5)   -> Teori: E={b_prime_p:.3f}, Var={b_dprime_p:.3f} | Empiris(50k): E={samp_p.mean():.3f}, Var={samp_p.var():.3f}\")\nprint(f\"Gamma(mu=12,p=.25)-> Teori: E={b_prime_g:.3f}, Var={var_theo_g:.3f} | Empiris(50k): E={samp_g.mean():.3f}, Var={samp_g.var():.3f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Verifikasi First-Principles IRLS Lintas Keluarga EDF (True beta = [0.60, 0.45, -0.35]) ===\nKeluarga (Link)     | Iter |   b0_hat |   b1_hat |   b2_hat | Max |Score|\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNormal (Identity)   |    2 |  +0.6265 |  +0.4523 |  -0.3665 |    6.27e-11\nBernoulli (Logit)   |    5 |  +0.7129 |  +0.4185 |  -0.4652 |    7.14e-11\nPoisson (Log)       |    6 |  +0.5393 |  +0.4911 |  -0.3643 |    5.34e-11\nGamma (Log-Link)    |    7 |  +0.5896 |  +0.4791 |  -0.3693 |    9.20e-08\n=== Verifikasi Identitas Cumulant E[Y]=b'(theta) & Var(Y)=a(phi)b''(theta) ===\nPoisson(mu=4.5)   -> Teori: E=4.500, Var=4.500 | Empiris(50k): E=4.499, Var=4.527\nGamma(mu=12,p=.25)-> Teori: E=12.000, Var=36.000 | Empiris(50k): E=11.993, Var=35.602",
          "actualOutput": "=== Verifikasi First-Principles IRLS Lintas Keluarga EDF (True beta = [0.60, 0.45, -0.35]) ===\nKeluarga (Link)     | Iter |   b0_hat |   b1_hat |   b2_hat | Max |Score|\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNormal (Identity)   |    2 |  +0.6265 |  +0.4523 |  -0.3665 |    6.27e-11\nBernoulli (Logit)   |    5 |  +0.7129 |  +0.4185 |  -0.4652 |    7.14e-11\nPoisson (Log)       |    6 |  +0.5393 |  +0.4911 |  -0.3643 |    5.34e-11\nGamma (Log-Link)    |    7 |  +0.5896 |  +0.4791 |  -0.3693 |    9.20e-08\n=== Verifikasi Identitas Cumulant E[Y]=b'(theta) & Var(Y)=a(phi)b''(theta) ===\nPoisson(mu=4.5)   -> Teori: E=4.500, Var=4.500 | Empiris(50k): E=4.499, Var=4.527\nGamma(mu=12,p=.25)-> Teori: E=12.000, Var=36.000 | Empiris(50k): E=11.993, Var=35.602",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan algoritma Iteratively Reweighted Least Squares (IRLS) generik untuk Normal, Bernoulli, Poisson, dan Gamma log-link, serta memverifikasi identitas momen b'(theta) dan a(phi)b''(theta).",
