          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nfrom scipy.special import gammaln\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn = 1200\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 2))\nX_aug = np.column_stack([np.ones(n), X])\n# Exposure heterogen antara 0.05 tahun (18 hari) hingga 1.0 tahun penuh\nexposure = rng.uniform(0.05, 1.0, size=n)\n\nbeta_true = np.array([0.80, 0.55, -0.40])\nalpha_true = 0.75  # Parameter dispersi Negative Binomial NB2: Var = mu + alpha * mu^2\nmu_true = exposure * np.exp(X_aug @ beta_true)\n\n# Bangkitkan data count Overdispersed via campuran Gamma-Poisson (identik eksak dgn NB2!)\ngamma_rate = rng.gamma(shape=1.0 / alpha_true, scale=alpha_true * mu_true)\ny_count = rng.poisson(gamma_rate).astype(float)\ny_rate = y_count / exposure\n\n# 1. Poisson MLE dengan Log-Offset eksak pada target count y_i\ndef neg_ll_poisson_offset(beta):\n    mu = exposure * np.exp(np.clip(X_aug @ beta, -15.0, 15.0))\n    return float(np.sum(mu - y_count * np.log(np.maximum(mu, 1e-12))))\n\n# 2. Weighted Poisson MLE pada target rate r_i = y_i / E_i dengan bobot w_i = E_i\ndef neg_ll_poisson_weighted_rate(beta):\n    rate_hat = np.exp(np.clip(X_aug @ beta, -15.0, 15.0))\n    return float(np.sum(exposure * (rate_hat - y_rate * np.log(np.maximum(rate_hat, 1e-12)))))\n\nres_off = minimize(neg_ll_poisson_offset, np.zeros(3), method=\"BFGS\")\nres_wgt = minimize(neg_ll_poisson_weighted_rate, np.zeros(3), method=\"BFGS\")\n\n# 3. Negative Binomial (NB2) Joint MLE untuk (beta, log_alpha) dengan offset log(E_i)\ndef neg_ll_nb2(params):\n    beta = params[:3]\n    alpha = float(np.exp(np.clip(params[3], -10.0, 5.0)))\n    r = 1.0 / alpha\n    mu = exposure * np.exp(np.clip(X_aug @ beta, -15.0, 15.0))\n    ll = (\n        gammaln(y_count + r)\n        - gammaln(r)\n        - gammaln(y_count + 1.0)\n        + r * np.log(r / (r + mu))\n        + y_count * np.log(mu / (r + mu))\n    )\n    return float(-np.sum(ll))\n\nres_nb2 = minimize(neg_ll_nb2, np.array([res_off.x[0], res_off.x[1], res_off.x[2], -0.5]), method=\"BFGS\")\nbeta_nb2 = res_nb2.x[:3]\nalpha_hat = float(np.exp(res_nb2.x[3]))\n\n# Audit statistik Pearson Chi-Square/df dari model Poisson\nmu_pois = exposure * np.exp(X_aug @ res_off.x)\nphi_pearson = float(np.sum(((y_count - mu_pois) ** 2) / mu_pois) / (n - 3))\n\nprint(\"=== Verifikasi Ekuivalensi Offset MLE vs Weighted Rate MLE (Poisson) ===\")\nprint(f\"Beta Poisson Log-Offset  : {np.round(res_off.x, 5)}\")\nprint(f\"Beta Poisson Rate+Weight : {np.round(res_wgt.x, 5)}\")\nprint(f\"Max selisih absolut      : {float(np.max(np.abs(res_off.x - res_wgt.x))):.2e}\")\nprint(\"=== Deteksi Overdispersion & Estimasi Negative Binomial (NB2) ===\")\nprint(f\"Pearson Chi2 / df (Pois) : {phi_pearson:.3f} (>> 1.0 menandakan overdispersion berat!)\")\nprint(f\"Log-Likelihood Poisson   : {-res_off.fun - float(np.sum(gammaln(y_count + 1.0))):10.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Log-Likelihood NB2       : {-res_nb2.fun:10.2f} (peningkatan fit masif)\")\nprint(f\"Beta NB2 (true [0.80,0.55,-0.40]): {np.round(beta_nb2, 4)} | alpha_hat={alpha_hat:.3f} (true={alpha_true:.2f})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Verifikasi Ekuivalensi Offset MLE vs Weighted Rate MLE (Poisson) ===\nBeta Poisson Log-Offset  : [ 0.84061  0.521   -0.37225]\nBeta Poisson Rate+Weight : [ 0.84061  0.521   -0.37225]\nMax selisih absolut      : 3.20e-09\n=== Deteksi Overdispersion & Estimasi Negative Binomial (NB2) ===\nPearson Chi2 / df (Pois) : 1.899 (>> 1.0 menandakan overdispersion berat!)\nLog-Likelihood Poisson   :   -1898.51\nLog-Likelihood NB2       :   -1737.84 (peningkatan fit masif)\nBeta NB2 (true [0.80,0.55,-0.40]): [ 0.8443  0.5107 -0.3695] | alpha_hat=0.631 (true=0.75)",
          "actualOutput": "=== Verifikasi Ekuivalensi Offset MLE vs Weighted Rate MLE (Poisson) ===\nBeta Poisson Log-Offset  : [ 0.84061  0.521   -0.37225]\nBeta Poisson Rate+Weight : [ 0.84061  0.521   -0.37225]\nMax selisih absolut      : 3.20e-09\n=== Deteksi Overdispersion & Estimasi Negative Binomial (NB2) ===\nPearson Chi2 / df (Pois) : 1.899 (>> 1.0 menandakan overdispersion berat!)\nLog-Likelihood Poisson   :   -1898.51\nLog-Likelihood NB2       :   -1737.84 (peningkatan fit masif)\nBeta NB2 (true [0.80,0.55,-0.40]): [ 0.8443  0.5107 -0.3695] | alpha_hat=0.631 (true=0.75)",
