          "filename": "09_3_compound_poisson_gamma_tweedie_irls.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef sample_compound_poisson_gamma(mu: np.ndarray, phi: float, p: float, rng: np.random.Generator) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"Bangkitkan sampel eksak Tweedie (1 < p < 2) lewat Compound Poisson-Gamma (Jorgensen 1987).\"\"\"\n    lam = (mu ** (2.0 - p)) / (phi * (2.0 - p))\n    alpha = (2.0 - p) / (p - 1.0)\n    scale = phi * (p - 1.0) * (mu ** (p - 1.0))\n    n_events = rng.poisson(lam)\n    y = np.zeros(len(mu), dtype=float)\n    pos = n_events > 0\n    # Jumlah N variabel Gamma(alpha, scale) berdistribusi Gamma(N * alpha, scale)!\n    y[pos] = rng.gamma(shape=n_events[pos] * alpha, scale=scale[pos])\n    return y\n\ndef tweedie_irls_loglink(X: np.ndarray, y: np.ndarray, power: float = 1.5, max_iter: int = 25, tol: float = 1e-8):\n    \"\"\"First-Principles IRLS untuk Tweedie GLM (1 < p < 2) dengan log-link.\"\"\"\n    n, d = X.shape\n    X_aug = np.column_stack([np.ones(n), X])\n    beta = np.zeros(d + 1)\n    beta[0] = float(np.log(max(float(np.mean(y)), 1e-4)))\n    for _ in range(max_iter):\n        eta = np.clip(X_aug @ beta, -15.0, 15.0)\n        mu = np.exp(eta)\n        # Untuk log-link: g'(mu) = 1/mu dan V(mu) = mu^p -> W = mu^(2 - p)\n        w = mu ** (2.0 - power)\n        z = eta + (y - mu) / mu\n        XtW = X_aug.T * w\n        beta_new = np.linalg.solve(XtW @ X_aug + 1e-10 * np.eye(d + 1), XtW @ z)\n        if float(np.max(np.abs(beta_new - beta))) < tol:\n            beta = beta_new\n            break\n        beta = beta_new\n    return beta\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn = 1600\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 2))\nbeta_true = np.array([5.2, 0.55, -0.45])  # Skala premi murni ~ $180\nmu_true = np.exp(beta_true[0] + X @ beta_true[1:])\np_true, phi_true = 1.5, 85.0\n\ny_claim = sample_compound_poisson_gamma(mu_true, phi=phi_true, p=p_true, rng=rng)\nzero_frac = float(np.mean(y_claim == 0.0))\ntheo_zero = float(np.mean(np.exp(-(mu_true ** (2.0 - p_true)) / (phi_true * (2.0 - p_true)))))\n\nbeta_hat = tweedie_irls_loglink(X, y_claim, power=1.5)\nmu_hat = np.exp(beta_hat[0] + X @ beta_hat[1:])\n\n# Verifikasi unit deviance Tweedie p=1.5\ndef mean_tw_dev(y_t, m_p, p=1.5):\n    term1 = np.where(y_t > 0, (y_t ** (2.0 - p)) / ((1.0 - p) * (2.0 - p)), 0.0)\n    term2 = (y_t * (m_p ** (1.0 - p))) / (1.0 - p)\n    term3 = (m_p ** (2.0 - p)) / (2.0 - p)\n    return float(np.mean(2.0 * (term1 - term2 + term3)))\n\nprint(\"=== Verifikasi Generator Compound Poisson-Gamma & First-Principles Tweedie IRLS ===\")\nprint(f\"Proporsi klaim tepat nol (P(S=0)) : Empiris={zero_frac*100:.2f}% | Teoretis={theo_zero*100:.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"Persentil klaim [P50, P80, P95, Max]: {np.round(np.percentile(y_claim, [50, 80, 95, 100]), 1)}\")\nprint(f\"Beta True                         : {np.round(beta_true, 4)}\")\nprint(f\"Beta Tweedie IRLS (p=1.5)         : {np.round(beta_hat, 4)}\")\nprint(f\"Total Klaim Aktual vs Prediksi    : Aktual=${y_claim.sum():,.1f} | Pred=${mu_hat.sum():,.1f} (rasio={mu_hat.sum()/y_claim.sum():.4f})\")\nprint(f\"Mean Tweedie Deviance (p=1.5)     : Model={mean_tw_dev(y_claim, mu_hat):.3f} vs Null={mean_tw_dev(y_claim, np.full(n, y_claim.mean())):.3f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Verifikasi Generator Compound Poisson-Gamma & First-Principles Tweedie IRLS ===\nProporsi klaim tepat nol (P(S=0)) : Empiris=73.88% | Teoretis=71.97%\nPersentil klaim [P50, P80, P95, Max]: [   0.   143.5 1410.8 8535.9]\nBeta True                         : [ 5.2   0.55 -0.45]\nBeta Tweedie IRLS (p=1.5)         : [ 5.1242  0.6543 -0.3794]\nTotal Klaim Aktual vs Prediksi    : Aktual=$353,064.0 | Pred=$352,838.4 (rasio=0.9994)\nMean Tweedie Deviance (p=1.5)     : Model=59.049 vs Null=67.169",
          "actualOutput": "=== Verifikasi Generator Compound Poisson-Gamma & First-Principles Tweedie IRLS ===\nProporsi klaim tepat nol (P(S=0)) : Empiris=73.88% | Teoretis=71.97%\nPersentil klaim [P50, P80, P95, Max]: [   0.   143.5 1410.8 8535.9]\nBeta True                         : [ 5.2   0.55 -0.45]\nBeta Tweedie IRLS (p=1.5)         : [ 5.1242  0.6543 -0.3794]\nTotal Klaim Aktual vs Prediksi    : Aktual=$353,064.0 | Pred=$352,838.4 (rasio=0.9994)\nMean Tweedie Deviance (p=1.5)     : Model=59.049 vs Null=67.169",
          "explanation": "Membangkitkan data zero-inflated eksak Compound Poisson-Gamma, memverifikasi P(S=0) = exp(-lambda), dan melatih Tweedie GLM (p=1.5) via IRLS dari nol.",
