          "filename": "09_3_sklearn_tweedie_vs_twopart_hgbr.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression, TweedieRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import mean_tweedie_deviance\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn = 1600\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, 3))\n# Proses asuransi realistis: frekuensi & severitas dipengaruhi fitur + sedikit non-linearitas\nfreq_true = np.exp(-1.55 + 0.50 * X[:, 0] - 0.35 * X[:, 1] + 0.25 * (X[:, 0] ** 2))\nsev_true = np.exp(6.10 + 0.30 * X[:, 1] + 0.45 * X[:, 2])\n\nn_claims = rng.poisson(freq_true)\ny_total = np.zeros(n, dtype=float)\npos = n_claims > 0\ny_total[pos] = rng.gamma(shape=n_claims[pos] * 2.5, scale=sev_true[pos] / 2.5)\n\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te, n_tr, n_te = train_test_split(\n    X, y_total, n_claims.astype(float), test_size=0.30, random_state=42\n)\n\n# 1. OLS mentah pada y_total\nm_ols = LinearRegression().fit(X_tr, y_tr)\npred_ols = m_ols.predict(X_te)\n\n# 2. ANTI-PATTERN: log1p(y) + OLS lalu expm1(pred) tanpa koreksi bias Jensen\nm_log = LinearRegression().fit(X_tr, np.log1p(y_tr))\nlog_hat_tr = m_log.predict(X_tr)\nlog_hat_te = m_log.predict(X_te)\npred_log_naive = np.maximum(np.expm1(log_hat_te), 1e-4)\n\n# 3. log1p(y) + OLS + Duan's Smearing Estimator\nduan_factor = float(np.mean(np.exp(np.log1p(y_tr) - log_hat_tr)))\npred_log_duan = np.maximum(duan_factor * np.exp(log_hat_te) - 1.0, 1e-4)\n\n# 4. Single-Stage TweedieRegressor (power=1.5)\nm_tw = TweedieRegressor(power=1.5, alpha=0.05, max_iter=500).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\npred_tw = m_tw.predict(X_te)\n\n# 5. Two-Part Frequency-Severity GBDT: HGBR(poisson) x HGBR(gamma pada y > 0)\nm_freq = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(loss=\"poisson\", max_depth=3, max_iter=80, random_state=42).fit(X_tr, n_tr)\npos_tr = y_tr > 0\nsev_tr_obs = y_tr[pos_tr] / n_tr[pos_tr]\nm_sev = HistGradientBoostingRegressor(loss=\"gamma\", max_depth=3, max_iter=80, random_state=42).fit(\n    X_tr[pos_tr], sev_tr_obs, sample_weight=n_tr[pos_tr]\n)\npred_two_part = m_freq.predict(X_te) * m_sev.predict(X_te)\n\nactual_sum = float(np.sum(y_te))\nprint(f\"Proporsi klaim=0 pada Test Set: {np.mean(y_te == 0)*100:.1f}% | Total Klaim Aktual: ${actual_sum:,.1f}\")\nprint(\"Model Pricing                    | Pred<0 | Total Pred ($) | Ratio P/A | TwDev (p=1.5)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 86)\nfor name, pr in [\n    (\"1. OLS Mentah                   \", pred_ols),\n    (\"2. log1p + OLS Naif (Jensen Bug)\", pred_log_naive),\n    (\"3. log1p + OLS + Duan Smearing  \", pred_log_duan),\n    (\"4. TweedieRegressor (p=1.5)     \", pred_tw),\n    (\"5. Two-Part HGBR (Pois x Gamma) \", pred_two_part),\n]:\n    neg_n = int(np.sum(pr <= 0.0))\n    tot_p = float(np.sum(pr))\n    ratio_pa = tot_p / actual_sum\n    dev_str = \"INVALID (<=0)\" if neg_n > 0 else f\"{float(mean_tweedie_deviance(y_te, pr, power=1.5)):13.3f}\"\n    print(f\"{name:32s} | {neg_n:6d} | {tot_p:14,.1f} | {ratio_pa:9.4f} | {dev_str:>13s}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Proporsi klaim=0 pada Test Set: 74.8% | Total Klaim Aktual: $86,114.0\nModel Pricing                    | Pred<0 | Total Pred ($) | Ratio P/A | TwDev (p=1.5)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. OLS Mentah                    |     83 |       86,960.6 |    1.0098 | INVALID (<=0)\n2. log1p + OLS Naif (Jensen Bug) |      0 |        3,496.2 |    0.0406 |      2172.859\n3. log1p + OLS + Duan Smearing   |      0 |      121,157.1 |    1.4069 |        49.283\n4. TweedieRegressor (p=1.5)      |      0 |       88,845.7 |    1.0317 |        47.704\n5. Two-Part HGBR (Pois x Gamma)  |      0 |       85,045.0 |    0.9876 |        47.633",
          "actualOutput": "Proporsi klaim=0 pada Test Set: 74.8% | Total Klaim Aktual: $86,114.0\nModel Pricing                    | Pred<0 | Total Pred ($) | Ratio P/A | TwDev (p=1.5)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. OLS Mentah                    |     83 |       86,960.6 |    1.0098 | INVALID (<=0)\n2. log1p + OLS Naif (Jensen Bug) |      0 |        3,496.2 |    0.0406 |      2172.859\n3. log1p + OLS + Duan Smearing   |      0 |      121,157.1 |    1.4069 |        49.283\n4. TweedieRegressor (p=1.5)      |      0 |       88,845.7 |    1.0317 |        47.704\n5. Two-Part HGBR (Pois x Gamma)  |      0 |       85,045.0 |    0.9876 |        47.633",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan 5 strategi pricing klaim zero-inflated (OLS, log1p naif, log1p+Duan, TweedieRegressor p=1.5, dan Two-Part HGBR Poisson x Gamma) pada rasio total portofolio dan Tweedie Deviance.",
