          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef tweedie_d2_and_ae_ratio(y_true, y_pred, power: float = 1.5, sample_weight=None) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    y = np.asarray(y_true, dtype=float)\n    mu = np.asarray(y_pred, dtype=float)\n    w = np.ones_like(y) if sample_weight is None else np.asarray(sample_weight, dtype=float)\n    # TODO: hitung unit deviance Tweedie (hati-hati y==0!), D_model, D_null pada y_bar terboboti, d2 & A/E\n    pass\n\ny_t = [0.0, 120.0, 0.0, 450.0, 80.0, 0.0, 310.0, 40.0]\ny_p = [25.0, 110.0, 35.0, 380.0, 95.0, 20.0, 260.0, 55.0]\nw_s = [1.0, 1.0, 0.5, 1.0, 0.8, 0.5, 1.0, 0.6]\nprint(tweedie_d2_and_ae_ratio(y_t, y_p, power=1.5, sample_weight=w_s))",
